{"step_index":24,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:07:51Z","input_tokens":10564,"cache_read_tokens":73411,"output_tokens":1367,"content":"**Step 2 (Main Goal)** is now integrated into the application across [tracer.js](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/tracer.js), [app.js](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app.js), [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/index.html), and [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/styles.css).\n\n### How Every Beginner Question from Step 2 is Addressed:\n1. **What happens when the code starts executing?**\n   - Added a dedicated **`PROGRAM_START`** step that explains how Python creates the empty `Global Frame (main)` in memory and places the instruction pointer at the first executable line.\n2. **Which line executes first, second, third, and next?**\n   - Each executed line in the source editor now displays chronological **execution order badges** (`#1`, `#2`, `#3`...) alongside the active pointer (`▶`) and upcoming line indicator (`↳`).\n3. **What does each variable contain at every step?**\n   - The **Live Variables** panel tracks every variable by scope, data type (`int`, `str`, `list`, `bool`), current value, previous value (`old → new`), and visual list index cells (`[0]`, `[1]`...).\n4. **How do loops work internally?**\n   - Added a dynamic **🔄 How This Loop Works Internally** visual card ([`renderMechanicsCard`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app.js#L486-L607)) that renders the sequence strip (`[4, 7, 10, 3, 8]`) with a moving pointer (`▼ num`), completed checkmarks (`✓`), and current pass counter (`Pass 2 of 5`).\n5. **How do conditions evaluate to True or False?**\n   - Added a **⚖️ Condition Truth Evaluator** card ([`analyzeConditionDetails`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/tracer.js#L351-L386)) that breaks every `if`/`elif`/`while` condition into **Left Operand** | **Operator** | **Right Operand** $\\rightarrow$ **`✓ TRUE`** or **`✗ FALSE`**.\n6. **How does the program decide which line to execute next?**\n   - Added a dedicated **🧭 How Python Decides Which Line Runs Next** mentor card ([`explainNextLineDecision`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/tracer.js#L168-L199)) explaining whether Python moves sequentially, enters/skips an indented block, loops back to a header, or jumps into/out of a function.\n7. **How do functions, parameters, arguments, and return statements work?**\n   - Added a **📦 Function Parameter Binding & Return Handoff** card that visually maps each `Caller Argument` $\\rightarrow$ `Function Parameter` when a new Call Stack frame is pushed, and shows how `return` sends the result back to the caller line.\n8. **How does the final answer get calculated?**\n   - Added a **\"How Final Answer is Calculated\"** tab ([`renderVariableTimeline`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app.js#L436-L484)) showing the complete chronological calculation table of every variable update from Step 1 to the final output.\n9. **Why does the code work this way?**\n   - Added a **👨‍💻 Senior Dev Big Picture** banner plus a per-step **🔍 Why It Works This Way** mentor explanation written like a patient senior developer sitting next to you.\n\n---\n\n**Ready for Step 3!** Send over the next step whenever you're ready.","thinking":"The execution tracer and UI now incorporate all nine beginner questions. Specifically, a `PROGRAM_START` step visually represents the response to the initial question regarding program execution initiation. This integration aims to provide a clear and accessible visualization of the code's behavior.\n\n\nThe program begins by establishing a global memory frame and initializing the instruction pointer. The system will then track the sequence of execution by using inline step-order badges on source code lines, updating a live variable inspector to show variable contents at each step. This also includes dedicated visualizers for loop internals and condition evaluations.\n\n\n"}
{"step_index":25,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:09:38Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\n3. Core Interface Design\n\nCreate a modern, professional, interactive developer-learning workspace.\n\nUse a dark developer theme with excellent readability, subtle borders, smooth transitions, and a clean layout. Avoid excessive gradients, unnecessary animations, and clutter.\n\nMain workspace\n\nA. Code Editor — Left Panel\n\nProvide a real code editor with Python syntax highlighting.\nAllow users to paste, edit, and write code.\nInclude line numbers and readable indentation.\nSupport a language selector, starting with Python.\nAdd buttons for Load Example, Reset, and Analyze Code.\nHighlight the currently executing line.\nClearly distinguish executed lines, the current line, and upcoming lines.\nPreserve the original code while stepping through execution.\n\nB. Execution Flow — Center Panel\n\nThis is the most important part of the interface.\n\nShow the execution process in a visual, step-by-step format.\n\nInclude:\n\nCurrent execution line.\nStep number and total steps, when known.\nA clear explanation of what happens at this step.\nVariable values before and after the step.\nThe result of conditions and comparisons.\nLoop iteration number.\nThe next line that will execute.\nA visual execution path showing branches and loops.\n\nUse simple flowchart elements for decisions, loops, function calls, and returns when useful.\n\nC. Variable Inspector — Right Panel\n\nDisplay a live view of the program's variables.\n\nFor every execution step, show:\n\nVariable name.\nPrevious value.\nNew value.\nData type.\nWhether the variable was created, updated, or unchanged.\n\nHighlight changed values so beginners immediately notice what happened.\n\nFor example:\n\nVariable\tPrevious\tCurrent\nc\t0\t-2\nans\t4\t4\ni\t1\t2\n\nUpdate this panel whenever the user moves to another execution step.\n\nD. Beginner Explanation Panel\n\nProvide a dedicated explanation area below the execution workspace.\n\nExplain the current line in simple English, as if teaching someone who has just started programming.\n\nFor each step, explain:\n\nWhat the line does.\nWhat each important variable means.\nWhy this line is executing now.\nWhat changed because of this line.\nWhat happens next.\n\nAvoid complicated terminology unless you explain it first.\n\nProvide an optional \"Explain Like I'm 10\" mode and a \"More Technical Detail\" mode.\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-10T15:39:38+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":26,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:09:39Z","input_tokens":4327,"cache_read_tokens":81674,"output_tokens":7836,"thinking":"Workspace structure must adhere precisely to Step 3's core interface design. The primary focus is achieving a modern, professional dark developer theme with superior readability and subtle aesthetics, as explicitly mandated. Component layout and visual elements will be meticulously aligned to fulfill these requirements.\n\n\nThe interface design necessitates specific panel placement within a dark developer theme for enhanced readability. The left panel must house a Python code editor with syntax highlighting, alongside controls for example loading, resetting, and code analysis. The center panel is crucial for visually representing the execution flow.\n\n\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe task involves updating a CSS file, specifically `styles.css`. This requires understanding the existing structure and intended modifications to incorporate. Initial focus will be on assessing the current styles before making any changes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n  --bg-app: #0d1117;\n  --bg-panel: #161b22;\n  --bg-elevated: #1c2128;\n  --bg-input: #0d1117;\n  --bg-hover: #21262d;\n\n  --border-subtle: #30363d;\n  --border-muted: #21262d;\n  --border-focus: #58a6ff;\n\n  --text-primary: #e6edf3;\n  --text-secondary: #8b949e;\n  --text-muted: #6e7681;\n\n  --accent-blue: #58a6ff;\n  --accent-green: #3fb950;\n  --accent-amber: #d29922;\n  --accent-red: #f85149;\n  --accent-purple: #bc8cff;\n  --accent-cyan: #39c5cf;\n\n  /* Line execution states */\n  --line-current-bg: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.16);\n  --line-current-border: #58a6ff;\n  --line-executed-bg: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.06);\n  --line-executed-border: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.45);\n  --line-next-bg: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.12);\n  --line-next-border: #d29922;\n\n  /* Syntax Highlighting Colors (GitHub Dark Pro inspired) */\n  --syn-keyword: #ff7b72;\n  --syn-builtin: #d2a8ff;\n  --syn-string: #a5d6ff;\n  --syn-number: #79c0ff;\n  --syn-comment: #8b949e;\n  --syn-op: #ff7b72;\n  --syn-func: #d2a8ff;\n\n  --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', Consolas, monospace;\n\n  --radius-sm: 5px;\n  --radius-md: 8px;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: var(--bg-app);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  height: 100vh;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* Top Application Bar */\n.app-header {\n  height: 50px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-panel);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 0 16px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n  width: 28px;\n  height: 28px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background-color: #1f6feb;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.brand-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.brand-tag {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--accent-blue);\n  background: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.1);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.3);\n  padding: 1px 7px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n/* Playback Transport Controls in Header */\n.transport-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.scrubber-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  width: 260px;\n  margin: 0 8px;\n}\n\n.step-badge {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"range\"].timeline-slider {\n  -webkit-appearance: none;\n  appearance: none;\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 5px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  background: var(--border-subtle);\n  outline: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"range\"].timeline-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n  -webkit-appearance: none;\n  appearance: none;\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--accent-blue);\n  border: 2px solid var(--bg-panel);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.speed-select {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 4px 6px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  outline: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* Buttons & Inputs */\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  padding: 5px 11px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  transition: background 0.12s ease, border-color 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.btn:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  border-color: #484f58;\n}\n\n.btn:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #238636;\n  border-color: rgba(240, 246, 252, 0.1);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #2ea043;\n}\n\n.btn-accent {\n  background: #1f6feb;\n  border-color: rgba(240, 246, 252, 0.1);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.btn-accent:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #388bfd;\n}\n\n.select-input {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 4px 8px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  outline: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* Upper 3-Column Workspace (Panels A, B, C) */\n.upper-workspace {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1.3fr 1fr;\n  gap: 1px;\n  background-color: var(--border-subtle);\n  min-height: 0;\n}\n\n.panel {\n  background-color: var(--bg-panel);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-height: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.panel-header {\n  height: 38px;\n  padding: 0 12px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.panel-title {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.panel-toolbar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================\n   PANEL A: Code Editor — Left Panel\n   ========================================== */\n.editor-subbar {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-app);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 6px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.line-state-legend {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  padding: 5px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-panel);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.legend-pill {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n}\n\n.legend-swatch {\n  width: 9px;\n  height: 9px;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n.swatch-current {\n  background: var(--line-current-bg);\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-current-border);\n}\n\n.swatch-executed {\n  background: var(--line-executed-bg);\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-executed-border);\n}\n\n.swatch-next {\n  background: var(--line-next-bg);\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-next-border);\n}\n\n.swatch-upcoming {\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 1px dashed var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.editor-main-area {\n  flex: 1;\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n}\n\n.code-lines-container {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n}\n\n.code-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 1px 12px 1px 0;\n  border-left: 3px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.code-row:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n}\n\n.code-row.state-current {\n  background-color: var(--line-current-bg);\n  border-left-color: var(--line-current-border);\n}\n\n.code-row.state-executed {\n  background-color: var(--line-executed-bg);\n  border-left-color: var(--line-executed-border);\n}\n\n.code-row.state-next {\n  background-color: var(--line-next-bg);\n  border-left-color: var(--line-next-border);\n}\n\n.code-row.state-upcoming {\n  opacity: 0.78;\n}\n\n.code-gutter {\n  width: 56px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  padding-right: 10px;\n  gap: 5px;\n  user-select: none;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.gutter-marker {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  width: 14px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.gutter-ln {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n}\n\n.code-syntax {\n  white-space: pre;\n  flex: 1;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.code-row-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  margin-left: 8px;\n}\n\n.step-order-tag {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  padding: 0 5px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  background: rgba(139, 148, 158, 0.12);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.inline-state-tag {\n  font-size: 10.5px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  padding: 0 6px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  background: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.15);\n  color: var(--accent-blue);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Syntax Highlighting Spans */\n.syn-kw { color: var(--syn-keyword); font-weight: 600; }\n.syn-bi { color: var(--syn-builtin); }\n.syn-str { color: var(--syn-string); }\n.syn-num { color: var(--syn-number); }\n.syn-com { color: var(--syn-comment); font-style: italic; }\n.syn-fn { color: var(--syn-func); font-weight: 600; }\n\n/* Live Editable Code Mirror Overlay / Mode */\n.live-editor-wrap {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n}\n\n.editor-line-numbers {\n  width: 44px;\n  padding: 10px 8px 10px 0;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  background: var(--bg-panel);\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  user-select: none;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.code-textarea {\n  flex: 1;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  resize: none;\n  tab-size: 4;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================\n   PANEL B: Execution Flow — Center Panel\n   ========================================== */\n.flow-panel-content {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.flow-status-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.metric-box {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 7px 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n\n.metric-label {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.metric-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.metric-value.highlight-blue { color: var(--accent-blue); }\n.metric-value.highlight-amber { color: var(--accent-amber); }\n.metric-value.highlight-cyan { color: var(--accent-cyan); }\n\n.flow-step-card {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.flow-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  padding-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.flow-card-title {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.flow-code-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.flow-step-explanation {\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.flow-step-explanation code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.flow-details-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.flow-mini-box {\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.flow-mini-label {\n  font-size: 10.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.flow-mini-content {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.flowchart-box {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-height: 210px;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.flowchart-svg-wrap {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow: auto;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  padding: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================\n   PANEL C: Variable Inspector — Right Panel\n   ========================================== */\n.inspector-body {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.var-inspector-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.var-inspector-table th {\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 7px 8px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.var-inspector-table td {\n  padding: 7px 8px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.var-inspector-table tr.row-created {\n  background: rgba(57, 197, 207, 0.12);\n}\n\n.var-inspector-table tr.row-updated {\n  background: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.14);\n}\n\n.val-prev {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.val-curr {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.row-updated .val-curr {\n  color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.row-created .val-curr {\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.status-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.status-created {\n  background: rgba(57, 197, 207, 0.18);\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.status-updated {\n  background: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.2);\n  color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n.status-unchanged {\n  background: rgba(139, 148, 158, 0.12);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.console-box {\n  height: 115px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.console-output-scroll {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--accent-green);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================\n   PANEL D: Beginner Explanation Panel (Bottom)\n   ========================================== */\n.beginner-explanation-panel {\n  height: 215px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-panel);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.explanation-modes {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.mode-btn {\n  padding: 3px 10px;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.mode-btn.active {\n  background: #1f6feb;\n  border-color: #388bfd;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.explanation-cards-grid {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n  gap: 10px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.exp-card {\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.exp-card-title {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n  color: var(--accent-blue);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n}\n\n.exp-card-body {\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.exp-card-body code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  background: var(--bg-elevated);\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n","Description":"Update styles.css for Step 3 Core Interface Design (Panels A, B, C, and Bottom Panel D with clean dark developer theme)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\styles.css","toolAction":"Updating styles.css for Step 3 layout","toolSummary":"Update styles.css to match Step 3 Core Interface Design"}}]}
