{"step_index":28,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:10:44Z","input_tokens":8197,"cache_read_tokens":85814,"output_tokens":3093,"thinking":"Focusing on the architectural requirement of a four-panel layout for the visualization tool. The initial task is updating the main HTML file to accommodate the specified \"Code Editor — Left Panel\". Aiming for a layout that distinctly incorporates this panel alongside the other three components.\n\n\nConsidering how to best represent the provided information within the four-panel layout. Each panel presents distinct data types that should be clearly separated. The \"Code Editor\" will occupy one panel, \"Execution Flow\" will be central, \"Variable Inspector\" to the right, and \"Beginner Explanation\" at the bottom.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>CodeFlow Visualizer — Step-by-Step Python Execution Workspace</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Bar: Brand & Playback Transport -->\n  <header class=\"app-header\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-logo\">PY</div>\n      <div class=\"brand-title\">\n        CodeFlow Visualizer\n        <span class=\"brand-tag\">Interactive Execution &amp; Logic Workspace</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"transport-controls\">\n      <button id=\"btnFirst\" class=\"btn\" title=\"First Step\">|&lt;&lt; Start</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Previous Step (Left Arrow)\">&lt; Prev</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPlay\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" title=\"Play / Pause Execution (Space)\">▶ Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Next Step (Right Arrow)\">Next &gt;</button>\n      <button id=\"btnLast\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Last Step\">End &gt;&gt;|</button>\n\n      <div class=\"scrubber-wrap\">\n        <span id=\"stepBadge\" class=\"step-badge\">Step 1 / 1</span>\n        <input id=\"timelineSlider\" type=\"range\" class=\"timeline-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" value=\"0\" />\n      </div>\n\n      <select id=\"speedSelect\" class=\"speed-select\" aria-label=\"Playback Speed\">\n        <option value=\"1800\">0.5x Slow</option>\n        <option value=\"1100\" selected>1.0x Normal</option>\n        <option value=\"550\">2.0x Fast</option>\n        <option value=\"250\">4.0x Rapid</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Main Upper 3-Column Workspace (Panels A, B, C) -->\n  <main class=\"upper-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         A. CODE EDITOR — LEFT PANEL\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Code Editor\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">A. Code Editor</div>\n        <div class=\"panel-toolbar\">\n          <select id=\"languageSelect\" class=\"select-input\" aria-label=\"Language Selector\">\n            <option value=\"python\" selected>Python 3</option>\n          </select>\n          <select id=\"presetSelect\" class=\"select-input\" aria-label=\"Example Program\"></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"editor-subbar\">\n        <div class=\"panel-toolbar\">\n          <button id=\"btnLoadExample\" class=\"btn\">Load Example</button>\n          <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn\">Edit Code</button>\n          <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn\">Reset</button>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">⚡ Analyze Code</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"line-state-legend\">\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-current\"></span>Current Line</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-executed\"></span>Executed</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-next\"></span>Next Line</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-upcoming\"></span>Upcoming</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"editor-main-area\">\n        <!-- Syntax-Highlighted Execution View -->\n        <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-lines-container\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Editable Code View (Preserves Original Code) -->\n        <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n          <div id=\"editorLineNumbers\" class=\"editor-line-numbers\">1</div>\n          <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"Write or paste Python code here...\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         B. EXECUTION FLOW — CENTER PANEL\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Execution Flow\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">B. Execution Flow</div>\n        <span id=\"flowEventBadge\" class=\"brand-tag\">STATEMENT</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flow-panel-content\">\n        <!-- Top Key Metrics Row -->\n        <div class=\"flow-status-grid\">\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Step Progress</span>\n            <span id=\"metricStep\" class=\"metric-value\">1 / 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Current Line</span>\n            <span id=\"metricCurrentLine\" class=\"metric-value highlight-blue\">Line 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Next Line to Run</span>\n            <span id=\"metricNextLine\" class=\"metric-value highlight-amber\">Line 2</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Loop Iteration</span>\n            <span id=\"metricLoopIter\" class=\"metric-value highlight-cyan\">None</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Active Step Execution Breakdown Card -->\n        <div class=\"flow-step-card\">\n          <div class=\"flow-card-header\">\n            <span class=\"flow-card-title\">Executing Statement &amp; Step Summary</span>\n            <span id=\"flowEvaluationTag\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--accent-cyan);\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"flowCodeStatement\" class=\"flow-code-pill\"></div>\n          <div id=\"flowStepSummary\" class=\"flow-step-explanation\"></div>\n\n          <!-- Before/After Variable Values & Condition/Comparison Result -->\n          <div class=\"flow-details-row\">\n            <div class=\"flow-mini-box\">\n              <span class=\"flow-mini-label\">Variables (Before → After Step)</span>\n              <div id=\"flowBeforeAfter\" class=\"flow-mini-content\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flow-mini-box\">\n              <span class=\"flow-mini-label\">Condition / Comparison Result</span>\n              <div id=\"flowConditionResult\" class=\"flow-mini-content\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Visual Execution Path (Flowchart with Decisions, Loops, Calls, Returns) -->\n        <div class=\"flowchart-box\">\n          <div class=\"panel-header\" style=\"height:32px;\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">Visual Execution Path (Branches, Loops &amp; Calls)</div>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"flowchartSvgWrap\" class=\"flowchart-svg-wrap\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         C. VARIABLE INSPECTOR — RIGHT PANEL\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Variable Inspector\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">C. Variable Inspector</div>\n        <span id=\"activeScopeBadge\" class=\"brand-tag\">Global Scope</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"inspector-body\">\n        <table class=\"var-inspector-table\" aria-label=\"Live Variables Table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Variable</th>\n              <th>Previous</th>\n              <th>Current</th>\n              <th>Type</th>\n              <th>State</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"varInspectorTbody\"></tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <!-- Visual Array / List Memory Cells (when lists exist) -->\n        <div id=\"visualListsContainer\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Program Output (Console) -->\n      <div class=\"console-box\">\n        <div class=\"panel-header\" style=\"height:30px;\">\n          <div class=\"panel-title\">Console Output (print)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"consoleOutputScroll\" class=\"console-output-scroll\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       D. BEGINNER EXPLANATION PANEL — BOTTOM AREA\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section class=\"beginner-explanation-panel\" aria-label=\"Beginner Explanation Panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">\n        D. Beginner Explanation Panel — Step-by-Step Mentor Guide\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"explanation-modes\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-right:4px;\">Explanation Style:</span>\n        <button class=\"mode-btn active\" data-mode=\"beginner\">Simple English (Default)</button>\n        <button class=\"mode-btn\" data-mode=\"eli10\">Explain Like I'm 10</button>\n        <button class=\"mode-btn\" data-mode=\"technical\">More Technical Detail</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"explanation-cards-grid\">\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">1. What This Line Does</div>\n        <div id=\"expWhatLineDoes\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">2. What Each Variable Means</div>\n        <div id=\"expVariableMeaning\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">3. Why This Line Executes Now</div>\n        <div id=\"expWhyExecutingNow\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">4. What Changed at This Step</div>\n        <div id=\"expWhatChanged\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">5. What Happens Next</div>\n        <div id=\"expWhatHappensNext\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script src=\"tracer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update index.html to implement Step 3 Core Interface Design with Panels A, B, C, and Bottom Panel D","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating index.html for Step 3 Core Interface Design","toolSummary":"Update index.html with Panels A, B, C, and Bottom Panel D"}}]}
